# Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Table: copy-and-paste files
Create each file below in your GitHub repository, in this order. In your repo, click **Add file > Create new file**, type the file name exactly as shown in the heading (typing `src/rules.js` creates the `src` folder for you), paste the code, and click **Commit changes**. Repeat for all 12 files.
When you're done, go to **Settings > Pages**, set Source to *Deploy from a branch*, choose branch `main` and folder `/ (root)`, and your duel table will be live in about a minute.
Copy the code exactly, since a missing character will break a file. Use the copy button on each block if you see one.

